# Timeline

A component for displaying chronological events, such as a professional journey, project milestones, or a changelog.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/timeline.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/timeline.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/timeline.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { Timeline } from '@/registry/timeline'

const events = [
  {
    date: 'February 2024',
    title: 'Project Kickoff',
    description: 'Initial planning and team formation.',
    badge: 'New'
  },
  {
    date: 'March 2024',
    title: 'MVP Release',
    description: 'First functional prototype delivered.',
    link: { text: 'View Demo', url: '#' }
  }
]
</script>

<template>
  <Timeline :items="events" />
</template>
```

